# Changelog

## [0.3.1.8]

### Fixed
- bug fix: populate `array_type` with `VLBAhi` when reference frequency is above 20 GHz.
- default rPicard parameter values hold `fringe_exhaustive_refant_search_threshold` and `fringe_exhaustive_refant_search_islands` to `1.5` and `False` respectively.

#### Updated
- default `sci_solints` to `manual` instead of `auto` which was supposed to run an additional step selecting only the solints which can divide the scan in partitions maximum to the value defined `solint_max_scan_partitions`.

